WEBVTT

00:07:57.392 --> 00:08:00.160
Ahhhhh. Zelo dobro.

00:08:00.160 --> 00:08:02.132
Zdaj bomo ogreli naše ustnice

00:08:02.132 --> 00:08:04.484
in bomo govorili ba, ba, ba, ba,

00:08:04.484 --> 00:08:07.436
ba, ba, ba, ba. Zelo dobro.

00:08:07.436 --> 00:08:10.876
In zdaj, brrrrrrrrrr,

00:08:10.876 --> 00:08:12.546
tako kot tedaj, ko ste bili otroci.

00:08:12.546 --> 00:08:14.853
Brrrr. No, zdaj bi morale
vaše ustnice oživeti.

00:08:14.853 --> 00:08:16.428
Sedaj je na vrsti jezik.

00:08:16.428 --> 00:08:20.850
Pretiravajte z la, la, la, la, la, la.

00:08:20.850 --> 00:08:22.470
Krasno. Res postajate dobri v tem.

00:08:22.470 --> 00:08:25.955
In potem recite trdo R. Rrrrrrrrr.

00:08:25.955 --> 00:08:28.171
To je kot šampanjec za jezik.

00:08:28.171 --> 00:08:30.491
In na koncu, če lahko naredim samo eno,